          "title": "You'll want to know: общество",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "общество (óbshchestvo) — \"society\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В современном обществе много проблем. V sovreménnom óbshchestve mnógo problém. There are many problems in modern society."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. It also means a society or club: общество (óbshchestvo) любителей книги."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "общество (óbshchestvo) was taken from Church Slavonic obĭščĭstvo (EtymDB), built on общий \"common, shared\": society is what people have in common."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
